## Protocol and naming rights

This license covers the software implementation and documentation that StellarNet LLC publishes in this repository. It does **not** grant or claim:

- ownership of the DNS root, any top-level domain, or any registry operated by another party;
- ownership of names that have been registered by another registrant;
- trademark rights merely from generating or displaying a name;
- an exclusive right to the string ".forever" outside rights actually obtained through an applicable registry, protocol governance system, contract, or other legally recognized mechanism;
- permanent availability of any domain, namespace, URI scheme, hosting service, or resolver.

OEQL identifiers generated by the Commons interface are protocol identifiers. They are not, solely because they were generated, proof of legal title to a domain name.

## Free public use

The intended public model is free protocol use: anyone may implement compatible software and create deterministic identifiers without paying StellarNet LLC a protocol-use fee. External costs imposed by registries, networks, hosting providers, registrars, or other infrastructure remain outside this license.

